A special event to celebrate the first major update introduced to '''Minna de Nyanko Daisensou'''. This event was held during January 16, 2018 to January 31, 2018.

==Event Information==
■ Large Update 1st bullet detail

1: New attribute enemy character 「 Zombie 」 is coming!! 「Zombie stage 」 Finally implemented！
　The very popular ultra-high difficulty zombie stage, even in the original 「 Nyanko Great War 」, is finally implemented in 「 Everyone Nanko Great War 」！！The Zombie Stage is a well-balanced stage where new attributes of enemy zombies emerge and require different capture methods. By clearing the zombie stage, you can get 10 cats per clear and you can get a variety of clear benefits, such as increasing your treasure lottery probability, so you can increase your strength efficiently！Please try it with your favorite Nanko Corps.

Part 2: Zombie stage savior!! 「Revolutionary Army Iron Wars 」 Implementation！

　Formidable New Attribute Enemy Cara 「 Zombie 」 New character series with ability to exert powerful force 「 Zombie Killer 」 Revolutionary Army Iron Wars 「 will be implemented in Leagacha! 」There are three types of Revolutionary Army Iron Wars 」 that operate ancient weapons 「 Imperial Army Catapals 」 「 Ancient Army Garage 」 「 Flying Air Raid Bombers 」, and nurture. Evolve into a super-giant weapon and burn enemies!! 「Take an overwhelming attack on the zombie 」 Get the Revolutionary Army Iron Wars 「 and take advantage of 」 Zombie Stage 「！

　Period: January 16, 2018 15:00 ～ January 19, 2018 10:59
▲ Imperial Army Catapals
▲ Ancient warship garage
▲ Flying Air Raid Bombers

■ Large Update 1st Round Implementation Memorial Campaign Details
Limited to 1:1 day! 「Necokan Super Daian Sale 」 Campaign held！
　Twenty-five feline cans, usually worth 100 yen, will hold a campaign that can be purchased for 10 yen. You can buy it once a day and the number of purchases will be reset at 0 o'clock. Don't miss this limited-time opportunity！

　Period: January 16, 2018 15:00 ～ January 31, 2018 23:59

2: 「 Necocan increase campaign 」 held！

　
「 Ultra High Difficulty Zombie Stage 」 To celebrate the implementation, we will hold 「 Necocan Increase Campaign 」. 3800 Necocans that can be purchased at the item shop are 4000 Necocans at the same price！Further with XP477,115 haunt！Enhance the characters you have efficiently obtained with bonus XP！

　Period: January 16, 2018 15:00 ～ January 19, 2018 10:59

